WEBVTT

NOTE
Tonberry - Chef's Knife. Slow-walking pilgrim summon.
Observed duration in reference video: ~38 seconds.
The slow approach is iconic; most of the duration is the walk.

00:00.000 --> 00:02.500
Tonberry. Chef's Knife.

00:02.500 --> 00:09.000
A small green-skinned figure in a brown hooded robe materializes in a stone hall.

00:09.000 --> 00:18.000
Tonberry begins to walk forward, slowly, lantern raised in one hand.

00:18.000 --> 00:26.000
Step by step he closes the distance, blank yellow eyes fixed on the target.

00:26.000 --> 00:32.000
He raises the chef's knife in his other hand, then plunges it into his target.

00:32.000 --> 00:38.000
The blow lands. Tonberry turns and shuffles back into the dark.
